description	"Sovereign Protector

Elite Vanguards with high resistances and powerful weaponry.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- Cripples on hit
-- 10% faster RoF
- SP-C10 Blaster Carbine (E-22) (1)
-- Mag Reload
-- +30% Damage/FP Drain
-- +30% Velocity
-- +50% RoF
-- Small Clipsize
- SE-44C Auto Pistol (DC Carbine) (1)
-- Mag Reload
-- +99.95 RoF
-- +40 Velocity
-- -25% Damage/FP Drain
-- Small Mag Size

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- Beskar Armor (2)
- Cortosis Armor (1)
- Strength (1)
- Blast Armor
- Magnetic Plating
- Environmental Protection (1)
- Melee Resist
- Anti-Mind Trick (1)
- Tracking Beacon
- Assemble (3)
- Knockdown Roll

^8Abilities:
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]
- Forcefield ^3[CS4]"